hint: After taking item 2, w = 2. Does box (2, 2) differ from box (1, 2)?
right: `[0, 2] 8`. A box that equals the box above means the item wasn't needed, so on a tie the walk prefers the earlier item.
wrong: Box (3, 5) = 8 differs from (2, 5) = 6: item 2 taken, w = 2. Box (2, 2) = 3 equals (1, 2) = 3: skip item 1. Box (1, 2) = 3 differs from 0: item 0.

