=== task: cells hard
title: Counting subsets by hand
prompt: The one-row subset count from the medium tasks runs on [2, 3, 5] with totals up to 10: `ways[0] = 1`, and for each number x, the totals from 10 down to x get `ways[s] += ways[s - x]`. Fill in the final counts.
code:
