labels: ways[5] | ways[7] | ways[8] | ways[10]
answer: 2 | 1 | 1 | 1
wrong[1 | 1 | 1 | 1]: 5 can be made in two ways: 5 alone and 2 + 3.
wrong[2 | 2 | 1 | 1]: 7 is only 2 + 5: 3 + 4 isn't possible with these numbers.
wrong[2 | 1 | 1 | 0]: 10 is 2 + 3 + 5, all three numbers: 1 way.
